[CENTER]
[SIZE=7][B][COLOR=#E74C3C]R[/COLOR][COLOR=#F39C12]T[/COLOR][COLOR=#27AE60]P[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[SIZE=4][B][COLOR=#7F8C8D]Random Teleport — the engine[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

[I]Send your players to a safe, random spot — fast, fair, and engineered not to lag your server.[/I]

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#27AE60][B]100% Free.[/B][/COLOR] Same engine as the paid [B]RTP-Pro[/B] build. No paywalled [I]/rtp[/I], no nag screens, no ads — just anonymous [URL='https://bstats.org/']bStats[/URL] usage stats (server-admin opt-out via [I]plugins/bStats/config.yml[/I]).[/SIZE]

