[B]Architecture support matrix[/B] — [I](Spigot / Paper-and-forks / Folia)[/I]
[LIST]
[*][B]RTP[/B] — ✅🧪 Off-tick Anvil pre-filter · ✅🧪 Fully async via [I]getChunkAtAsync[/I] · ❌ See RTP-Pro
[*][B]RTP-Pro[/B] — ✅🧪 Same as base · ✅🧪 Same as base · ✅🧪 Region Scheduler + off-tick pre-filter, no 1-tick stalls
[*][B]BetterRTP[/B] — ⚠️📖 Sync chunk load on miss · ⚠️📖 No off-tick safety pre-filter · ✅🧪 Folia 1.21.11 functional, p99 ~1.2 s
[*][B]EzRTP[/B] — ❌🧪 [I]NoSuchMethodError[/I] on Spigot 1.20.1 (Paper-only API) · ✅📖 Works on Paper · ❓📖 Not advertised
[*][B]AsyRTP[/B] — ❌🧪 Fails to enable on Spigot 1.20.1 (Paper-only API in [I]onEnable[/I]) · ✅📖 Paper · ✅📖 Folia
[*][B]SorekillRTP[/B] — ⚠️❓ Designed for Redis cross-server, not single-server perf · ⚠️❓ Same · ❓📖
[*][B]AdvancedRTP[/B] — ⚠️📖 Safety-first, sync chunk load · ⚠️📖 Same · ❌📖
[*][B]JakesRTP[/B] — ⚠️📖 Async via flag; 10-slot cache · ✅📖 Same · ❌📖 No Folia
[*][B]EssentialsX /rtp[/B] — ✅📖 Main-thread chunk load per candidate · ✅📖 Same · ❌📖
[*][B]HuskHomes RTP[/B] — ✅📖 Bundled with homes suite · ⚠️📖 Same · ✅🧪 Folia functional, p99 ~900 ms
[/LIST]

[B]Caveats.[/B] 2 clients only (the number is a floor, not a ceiling); hardware, view distance, world state, and other plugins will move them. Paper RTP row reproduced n=2; other rows are n=1 on a single rig. Competitor plugins update frequently — corrections welcome via GitHub issue with a contradicting repro or doc link. Feature breadth, GUI, and claim-integration counts are not benchmarked; several competitors trade speed for those, which is a legitimate design choice.

Full methodology, raw CSVs, per-run analyses: [URL=https://github.com/dailystruggle/RTP/tree/V3-beta/helpers/StressTestRTP][I]helpers/StressTestRTP/[/I][/URL].
[/SPOILER]

