[SIZE=6][B][COLOR=#27AE60]Need Folia, a proxy network, or paid support?[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]
[B]RTP-Pro[/B] is a drop-in upgrade — same configuration, same data files, same commands. It adds:
[LIST]
[*][B]Folia[/B] adapter (Region Scheduler + off-tick pre-filter, no 1-tick stalls)
[*][B]Multi-server / proxy[/B] support (Velocity, BungeeCord) — planned in [I]3.0.0-beta.3[/I]
[*]SQL / Redis shared-state backends (H2, SQLite, MySQL, PostgreSQL, Jedis)
[*][B]Vault[/B] economy, multilingual [I]lang/**[/I], login-reserve cache, visitor mode
[*]The richer [I]safety.yml[/I] grammar: vanilla block tags ([I]#minecraft:leaves[/I]), state predicates ([I]OAK_SLAB[waterlogged=true][/I]), wildcards ([I]*[waterlogged=true][/I])
[*]Earliest releases on each version + priority support within a documented response window
[/LIST]

